# Google OAuth — required for real "Sign in with Google"
# Steps to get your Client ID:
#
# 1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Create a project (or select an existing one)
# 3. APIs & Services → OAuth consent screen
#    - User type: External  → click Create
#    - Fill in App name (e.g. "SPARK Warranty Ops"), support email, developer email → Save
# 4. APIs & Services → Credentials → + Create Credentials → OAuth client ID
#    - Application type: Web application
#    - Name: SPARK dev
#    - Authorized JavaScript origins:  http://localhost:5173
#    - Authorized redirect URIs:       http://localhost:5173
#    - Click Create — copy the Client ID (ends in .apps.googleusercontent.com)
# 5. Paste it below and restart the dev server (npm run dev)
#
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=402653791176-bnmv0s272l1p608t27ekib00hvj8s0vg.apps.googleusercontent.com
